<section class="mre-seo-answer-block" aria-label="Direct answer"><h2>What should you know before buying Appliances that fit your counter — not the other way around?</h2><p>Before buying, use this page as a shortlist and verify the final details on Amazon. Prioritize fit, current price, stock, seller, return window, warranty, and recent buyer feedback over one headline rating. That final check helps avoid stale prices, mismatched variants, and avoidable returns.</p></section> <p class="text-base text-cream-50/85 max-w-[36em] mt-4 leading-relaxed">We measure footprint, height, and cord reach on air fryers, coffee gear, blenders, and toasters built for small kitchens. No sponsor samples without disclosure.</p> <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6"> <a href="/pillars" class="btn-primary no-underline cursor-pointer text-sm md:text-base"> Browse guides <svg class="w-4 h-4 ml-2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg> </a> <a href="/how-we-test" class="btn-secondary no-underline cursor-pointer text-sm md:text-base"> How we test </a> </div> <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 mt-5 text-sm text-cream-50/75" role="list"> <li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-terracotta-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg> Measured width, depth, and height </li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-terracotta-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg> Retail buy — no undisclosed sponsor samples </li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-terracotta-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg> 23 appliances on the watchlist </li> </ul> <dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-cream-50/15 lg:hidden"> <div> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400">Depth target</dt> <dd class="font-display text-xl text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">12 in</dd> </div><div> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400">Cord reach</dt> <dd class="font-display text-xl text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">36 in</dd> </div><div> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400">SKUs measured</dt> <dd class="font-display text-xl text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">23+</dd> </div> </dl> </div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 min-h-[280px]"> <figure class="relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-cream-50/15 shadow-soft-lg min-h-[280px] md:min-h-[340px] lg:min-h-[380px]"> <img src="/images/hero/home.jpg" alt="Compact kitchen counter with small appliances arranged for footprint testing" loading="eager" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"> <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink-900/85 via-ink-900/20 to-transparent"></div> <figcaption class="absolute top-4 left-4 right-4"> <span class="inline-block font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.16em] uppercase bg-ink-900/70 text-cream-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg backdrop-blur-sm"> Small kitchens · Independent reviews </span> </figcaption> <figcaption class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 px-4 py-4 md:px-5 md:py-5"> <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-cream-50/95 leading-snug max-w-[32ch] font-display"> We measure before we recommend — width, depth, height, and whether the cord actually reaches your outlet without blocking the cabinet door. </p> </figcaption> </figure> <dl class="hidden lg:grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 rounded-xl border border-cream-50/10 bg-ink-900/40 px-3 py-3"> <div class="text-center px-1"> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400 leading-tight">Depth target</dt> <dd class="font-display text-lg text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">12 in</dd> </div><div class="text-center px-1"> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400 leading-tight">Cord reach</dt> <dd class="font-display text-lg text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">36 in</dd> </div><div class="text-center px-1"> <dt class="font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-wider text-terracotta-400 leading-tight">SKUs measured</dt> <dd class="font-display text-lg text-cream-50 leading-none mt-1">23+</dd> </div> </dl> </div>  </div> </div> </section> <section class="border-y border-cream-200 bg-white" aria-labelledby="trust-strip-heading"> <div class="max-w-site mx-auto px-4 sm:px-5 py-5 md:py-6"> <div class="mb-4"> <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-3" role="list" aria-label="Editorial trust indicators"> <li class="trust-badge"> <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-sage-500 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"> <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg>   <span>Steel-rule footprints</span> </li><li class="trust-badge">  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-sage-500 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle> <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path> </svg>  <span>Cord &amp; vent clearance</span> </li><li class="trust-badge">   <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-sage-500 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"> <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle> <path d="m4.9 4.9 14.2 14.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path> </svg> <span>No sponsor pay-to-play</span> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-4 md:gap-8 items-center"> <p id="trust-strip-heading" class="section-eyebrow whitespace-nowrap">Editorial standards</p> <blockquote class="font-display italic text-base md:text-lg text-ink-700 leading-snug border-0 m-0 p-0">
"Affiliate links only on gear we would buy for our own counters."
